%% SEQ-P1-OV — Overview: Doctor-to-Cashier flow (UC09 -> UC15) — AS-BUILT
%% OVERVIEW ONLY. Does not replace the detailed per-UC diagrams
%% (SEQ_P1_02..SEQ_P1_07). Error branches are omitted on purpose here.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor DR as Doctor
    actor CA as Cashier
    participant FE as React SPA
    participant API as NestJS API (Controllers + Services)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    DR->>FE: Open visit examination
    FE->>API: POST /visits/:id/open-examination
    API->>DB: examination.create(OPEN) + visit IN_EXAMINATION
    API-->>FE: examination (OPEN)

    DR->>FE: Save symptoms / diagnosis
    FE->>API: PATCH /examinations/:id
    API->>DB: examination.update + diagnoses (snapshot)

    opt prescription needed
        DR->>FE: Add drug lines
        FE->>API: PUT /examinations/:id/prescription
        API->>DB: prescription replace-all (price snapshot)
    end

    DR->>FE: Complete examination
    FE->>API: POST /examinations/:id/complete
    API->>DB: examination COMPLETED + visit COMPLETED

    CA->>FE: Issue invoice
    FE->>API: POST /visits/:id/invoice
    API->>DB: invoice ISSUED + items (consultation fee + drugs, snapshot)
    API-->>FE: invoice (ISSUED)

    CA->>FE: Record payment
    FE->>API: POST /invoices/:id/payments
    API->>DB: payment + invoice PARTIALLY_PAID / PAID
    API-->>FE: invoice (updated status)
